# Firebolt put into the graveyard without being cast - discarded to Faithless Looting - can still be flashed back
# (ruling 2021-03-19; CR 702.34a asks only that the card be in its owner's graveyard). It is a sorcery, so flashback
# keeps sorcery timing (CR 307.1): not offered on Bot2's turn, then cast on Bot1's own main phase for {4}{R}, dealing
# 2 damage and exiled. The Mountain discarded beside it and the Looting stay in the graveyard.

